---
const STREAM_TICKS = [4, 14, 24, 40, 52, 64, 76, 88, 100, 108];
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 270 118"
    width="100%"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Schematic of one agent step: tools one at a time, then the same tools run at once with results streamed"
  >
    <text x="0" y="10" font-style="italic" font-size="11" fill="#5f5f5f"
      >one at a time</text
    >
    <rect x="0" y="16" width="36" height="9" fill="#000000"></rect>
    <rect x="37" y="16" width="34" height="9" fill="#a7a7a7"></rect>
    <rect x="72" y="16" width="34" height="9" fill="#cdcdcd"></rect>
    <rect x="107" y="16" width="30" height="9" fill="#a7a7a7"></rect>
    <rect x="138" y="16" width="36" height="9" fill="#000000"></rect>
    <line x1="177" y1="12" x2="177" y2="29" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1"
    ></line>
    <text x="0" y="52" font-style="italic" font-size="11" fill="#5f5f5f"
      >at once, streamed</text
    >
    <rect x="0" y="58" width="36" height="9" fill="#000000"></rect>
    <rect x="37" y="69" width="34" height="7" fill="#a7a7a7"></rect>
    <rect x="37" y="78" width="30" height="7" fill="#cdcdcd"></rect>
    <rect x="37" y="87" width="26" height="7" fill="#a7a7a7"></rect>
    <rect x="72" y="58" width="36" height="9" fill="#000000"></rect>
    <line x1="111" y1="54" x2="111" y2="108" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1"
    ></line>
    {
      STREAM_TICKS.map((x) => (
        <rect x={x} y="99" width="2" height="7" fill="#000000" />
      ))
    }
    <text x="270" y="116" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#5f5f5f"
      >time →</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    One agent step. Black is the model, grey the tools, and the ticks are
    updates reaching the browser. Schematic.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
